  <p>
    CopyPatch automatically initializes SQLite with high-performance concurrency pragmas:
  </p>

  <CodeBlock code={sqlitePragmas} lang="sql" title="SQLite Pragmas" />

  <h3>Database Tables</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><code>auth_credentials</code>:</strong> Stores the Argon2id passphrase hash, salt, and timestamp. Exactly 1 row.</li>
    <li><strong><code>sessions</code>:</strong> Stores 256-bit cryptographically secure session hashes, expiration timestamps, and CSRF secrets.</li>
    <li><strong><code>locales</code>:</strong> Tracks active locale codes (e.g. <code>"en"</code>, <code>"tr"</code>), published revision numbers, and draft revisions.</li>
    <li><strong><code>patches</code>:</strong> Holds content strings keyed by <code>(locale, content_key)</code> with published text, draft text, and modification timestamps.</li>
    <li><strong><code>revisions</code>:</strong> Immutable historical audit log of all changes for rollback capability.</li>
  </ul>

